  "details": "Description\n\nSpawning and despawning the Multiple Companion Cube prop multiple times will eventually result in the player no longer being able to spawn items with `[VRCItems] Tried spawning a prop but user did not have enough free Dynamic view IDs` being put in the log when attempting to and the Item not spawning.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Join a world\n\n2. Spawn and despawn the Multiple Companion Cube prop until it no longer spawns in\n\n3. The player is unable to spawn items anymore\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1896-3369f677b3-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-19_13-52-13.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_56ebe3c7-0475-4f61-bbae-1ccaffb43632/1/file)",
